            <description><![CDATA[
                <h3>Version 1.1.0</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Double-tap to click is now enabled by default</li>
                    <li>Fixed pointer speed — speed slider now visibly affects cursor velocity</li>
                    <li>3-finger swipe Back/Forward now works correctly in Finder (Cmd+[/])</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
